    "intro": "Amtec obligated $283M in FY2026 to date. Amtec received 15 awards this fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $18.9M. Obligations fell 29.5% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations have varied: Amtec obligated $248M in FY21, $70.4M in FY22, $138M in FY23, $513M in FY24, $401M in FY25, and $283M in FY26 to date. The current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date obligations rather than full-year totals. The note clarifies that the figures shown are contract obligations, while award-value figures in the largest-awards and expiring-contracts tables are total contract values. Use the listed fiscal-year totals and the reported award counts when comparing Amtec performance across years and when assessing current-year activity against prior full-year obligations.",
